    "description": "Duk-It (McDonald Products Corp.)\nSolid American Walnut with Brass Ferrule\nMid-Century Modern, Six-Pipe Capacity\nThis mid-century pipe rack was produced by McDonald Products Corp. of Buffalo, New York, under their renowned Duk-It line of executive desk accessories and tobacciana. Crafted from genuine American walnut, the stand showcases clean lines and a central tapered pedestal accented with a brass ferrule, reflecting classic mid-century functional design.\nSolid American walnut construction with rich natural wood grain throughout\nAccommodates up to six smoking pipes with carved base rests and circular top cutouts\nBrown felt protective base retains original Duk-It and Genuine American Walnut foil labels\nMeasures 6 inches long by 6 inches wide and 5.5 inches tall\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition with solid structural integrity and a stable base. Surface shows scattered light cosmetic wear, including several small white spots and blemishes on the upper surface of the base plate consistent with prior use. The brass collar retains age-appropriate patina, and the bottom felt and foil maker labels remain intact.",
